部和著名的所罗门奇达诺·曼达纳旅店。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q40921","articleTitle":"霍尼亚拉","sourceRevision":92783758,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 霍尼亚拉","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9C%8D%E5%B0%BC%E4%BA%9A%E6%8B%89"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92783758"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q40921"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159136841","name":"吉佐","country":"SLB","lat":-8.09962,"lon":156.83502,"kind":"city","region":"SB-CH","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"吉佐 · 地点概要","geo":"该地在离首都霍尼亚拉西北约380公里的吉佐岛上，正好位于科隆班加拉岛西南部。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1236908","articleTitle":"吉佐 (所罗门群岛)","sourceRevision":58734709,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 吉佐 (所罗门群岛)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%89%E4%BD%90%20%28%E6%89%80%E7%BD%97%E9%97%A8%E7%BE%A4%E5%B2%9B%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=58734709"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1236908"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159137041","name":"拉塔","country":"SLB","lat":-10.73802,"lon":165.85673,"kind":"city","region":"SB-TE","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"拉塔 · 地点概要","geo":"拉塔有一条小型飞机跑道，有飞往马基拉岛和荷尼阿拉的航班。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q646756","articleTitle":"拉塔 (所羅門群島)","sourceRevision":85184788,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文